    dcterms:created "2024-05-08"^^xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "Controls are measures that maintain and/or modify risk. In the NIOSH hierarchy, a control is a measure that is in place, is working effectively and operating to reduce either the likelihood or impact of a risk."@en ;
