    rdfs:subClassOf arkc:Control ;
    skos:definition "Controls are measures that maintain and/or modify risk. In the NIOSH hierarchy, a control is a measure that is in place, is working effectively and operating to reduce either the likelihood or impact of a risk."@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "NIOSH Control"@en .

